DLC_Dat["Scribes of Fate"].dat={
3468, -- Bal Sunnar Vanquisher,  Defeat Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni in Bal Sunnar.
3469, -- Bal Sunnar Conqueror,  Defeat Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3470, -- Telvanni Tormentor,  Defeat Matriarch Lladi Telvanni after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3471, -- Time's Arrow,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni within 25 minutes of entering Veteran Bal Sunnar. Your timer starts when you engage the first group of enemies.
3472, -- Fate's Master,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni in Veteran Bal Sunnar without suffering a group member death.
3473, -- Bal Sunnar Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3474, -- Temporal Tempest,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Bal Sunnar within 25 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts when you engage the first hostiles.
3476, -- One for Each of You,  Defeat Roksa the Warped after each player interrupts their own Darklight Ray without dying in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3477, -- Infectious Beliefs,  Allow four party members to suffer the effects of Infectious Vomit simultaneously prior to defeating Matriarch Lladi Telvanni in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3478, -- Strict Quarantine,  Defeat Matriarch Lladi Telvanni without a player taking damage from Pus Sacks in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3479, -- Time Out,  Freeze 40 monsters using the Time Shards while battling Matriarch Lladi Telvanni in Bal Sunnar.
3481, -- Fist of the Scourge,  Defeat Kovan Giryon after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3482, -- Nixterminator,  Defeat Roksa the Warped after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3483, -- Salvation's Legend,  Complete optional content in Bal Sunnar by solving the wheel puzzle, defeating Urvel Drath, and solving the Daedric beam puzzle.
3484, -- No Time to Waste,  Defeat Kovan Giryon, Roksa the Warped, and Matriarch Lladi Telvanni after raising the challenge banner and without gaining the benefits from completing optional content in Veteran Bal Sunnar.
3486, -- Scribes of Fate Delver,  Complete both Bal Sunnar and Scrivener's Hall on Veteran.
3487, -- Scribes of Fate Scout,  Complete both Bal Sunnar and Scrivener's Hall on Normal.
3488, -- Fate's Secrets,  Complete optional content in Bal Sunnar and Scrivener's Hall.
3529, -- Scrivener's Hall Vanquisher,  Defeat Riftmaster Naqri, Ozezan the Inferno, and Valinna in Scrivener's Hall.
3530, -- Scrivener's Hall Conqueror,  Defeat Riftmaster Naqri, Ozezan the Inferno, and Valinna in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3531, -- Inflammable,  Defeat Valinna after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3532, -- Speed Reader,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Riftmaster Naqri, Ozezan the Inferno, and Valinna within 25 minutes of entering Veteran Scrivener's Hall. Your timer starts when you engage the first hostiles.
3533, -- Unstilled Quill,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Riftmaster Naqri, Ozezan the Inferno, and Valinna in Veteran Scrivener's Hall without suffering a group member death.
3534, -- Scrivener's Hall Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3535, -- Magnastylus in the Making,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Riftmaster Naqri, Ozezan the Inferno, and Valinna after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Scrivener's Hall within 25 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts when you engage the first hostiles.
3536, -- Pest Control,  Squash 500 Broodlings in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3538, -- Harsh Edit,  Defeat Riftmaster Naqri after placing the challenge banner and burning Riftmaster Naqri's memoirs in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3539, -- Too Hot to Trot,  Defeat Ozezan the Inferno without a single party member being damaged by her Firestorm in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3540, -- Iced Enemies,  Freeze 60 hostile creatures using Mazandi's Freeze Circle in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3541, -- Unburnt Footwork,  Defeat Valinna and Lamikhai without a single party member setting off an Immolation Trap in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3542, -- Literate Combatant,  Defeat Riftmaster Naqri after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3543, -- Dousing Exterminator,  Defeat Ozezan the Inferno after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3544, -- Reinfyr's Hero,  Complete optional content in Scrivener's Hall by finding and defeating 10 Cartoklepts, looting 10 treasure chests in Scrivener's Hall Vault, and obtaining Reinfyr's lost Cartoklept Map.
3545, -- Keeper of the Keys,  Collect 10 Vault Keys in Veteran Scrivener's Hall.
3617, -- Bal Sunnar Champion,  Complete the listed achievements for Bal Sunnar.
3618, -- Scrivener's Hall Champion,  Complete the listed achievements for Scrivener's Hall.
3619, -- Ignivomous Weather,  All players avoid damage from falling rocks in the future section of Bal Sunnar.
3662, -- Missing Map Recovered,  Locate and dig up Scrivener's Treasure in the Rift.
3664, -- Vault Guardian,  Help Reinfyr protect the vault from the danger which skulks within.
